{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>EXPLORATION</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate five winding floors of a labyrinthine building, with discoveries and secrets waiting around every corner. Interact with objects to examine them and learn more about the building and its inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857680/extras/ea47f8afc8c1829f1a99d36f9762b5cd.poster.avif?t=1769281706\" width=540 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857680/extras/ea47f8afc8c1829f1a99d36f9762b5cd.webm?t=1769281706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857680/extras/ea47f8afc8c1829f1a99d36f9762b5cd.mp4?t=1769281706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>DRAMA</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story of love, murder, and vengeance, captured entirely with motion-capture technology. Choose who to follow as you maneuver this immersive theatrical experience, which draws inspiration from some of history's greatest plays. Collect pages in your book from each character to reveal their interwoven stories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>TIME TRAVEL</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reverse the flow of time to explore every location's every moment. Select a revealed passage from your book and immediately jump to that point in the story to travel quickly through both time and space.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857680?t=1769281706","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857680?t=1769281706","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857680/62ae443e84f2db9246403fecdb98de2b0